<title>LATVIA: LATVIA-ROJA Q1 PROFIT 48,239 LATS.</title>
<headline>LATVIA-ROJA Q1 PROFIT 48,239 LATS.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Roja cannery, a secondary list stock of the Riga bourse, had a first quarter profit of 48,239 lats on net turnover of 1.03 million lats, the stock exchange said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Roja production costs were 960,996 lats and administrative costs reached 10,588 lats, the bourse said in a statement.</p>
<p>The cannery had extraordinary costs of 2,883 lats, pushing its extraordinary profit or loss into negative territory with 2,750 lats.</p>
<p>Roja's balance sheet total after three months of 1997 was 2.41 million lats.</p>
<p>Roja earlier reported a 1996 profit of 68,819 lats.</p>
<p>-- Riga Newsroom, +371 721 5240</p>
</text>
